@bank all
// Head writer 0607: quiz night's mini-game (the user's, via lead 10): three multiple-choice questions about the ship
// a night, from this pool. All true to the game and learnable by playing (decks, crew, times, traditions, systems);
// easy to medium; the wrong answers are a little silly. TEXTS: quiz.q<n>.text is the question, quiz.q<n>.a1 is ALWAYS
// the right answer, a2-a4 the wrong ones (the game shuffles them). quiz.host.* are said by the quiz host (card or
// bubble, Tomas). {n} a score, {answer} the right answer.

== quiz.q1.text
- What's the name of the shuttle that brought you aboard?
== quiz.q1.a1
- The Tern
== quiz.q1.a2
